template: giantswarm/template-plans
command: devctl gen makefile --flavour plans --language generic
command: devctl gen workflows --flavour plans --language generic --repo-name example-plans --run-security-scorecard=false --release-workflow legacy
command: devctl gen llm --flavour plans --language generic
command: devctl gen plans --flavour plans
command: devctl gen renovate --language generic --repo-name example-plans

--- .agents/skills/x/SKILL.md
# x

A stub skill fixture, only there so template-plans' testdata carries a real
skill directory for the .claude/skills link to reach.

